\"full_label\">Following Leidstar</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=add_to_collection&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fmarkusaw.itch.io%2Fepoch\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://markusaw.itch.io/epoch/community\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Community</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://markusaw.itch.io/epoch/devlog\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/3332044/epoch\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" data-label=\"related_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_medium family_sans-serif\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMzU0NTAzLnBuZw==/original/FKSZoF.png\" alt=\"Epoch: Alternate History\"/><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">Epoch: Alternate History</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_8035689\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://markusaw.itch.io/epoch/purchase\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h1>What is Epoch: Alternate History?</h1>\r\n<p>Epoch&nbsp;is a grand strategy game focused on simulating world history. In the future, you will be able&nbsp;start in a wide range of different historical scenarios. From the earliest human societies to modern day.</p>\r\n<p>Every playthrough generates a completely unique alternate history, which can progress in a lot of different ways depending on yours and other nations actions.</p>\r\n<p>At early stages of the project there was no interactivity and it was not even meant to be a game. Just kind of an ant farm you could watch. It was inspired by a&nbsp;Facebook bot I saw a long time ago where countries would randomly grab territory from eachother. Then it turned into a game one day when I added the ability to declare war and I realized the potential of this project.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>I also draw inspiration from the Civilization games and many of the Paradox Interactive titles. Particularly a mod for Civilization IV called &quot;Caveman2Cosmos&quot; really inspired me.</p>\r\n<h1>About me</h1>\r\n<p>Hi! I\u2019m Markus, a solo developer from Norway. I started working on Epoch on June 1st, 2019.&nbsp; I am very interested in history and geography which is why I am able to work consistently on this project. Ever since I was a kid I have always been designing games in various forms. From board games made out of paper to fully working PC games. A lot of my games never got to a point where I felt satisfied enough to release them.&nbsp; Epoch still hasn&#x27;t reached that point in my mind, but I am releasing it regardless. I really don&#x27;t see a future where I abandon this project. In a way I am making the game for myself too.</p>\r\n<p>For me, Epoch is a passion project. The strategy game I always wanted to play. There&#x27;s always another thing to add or adjust. It&#x27;s an infinity project. A lot of people ask me when the game will be finished.&nbsp;But my goal isn&#x27;t to finish it, my goal is to make it fun and interesting to play. I have no plans to quit working on the project or end the development.</p>\r\n<p>Currently I work another job so&nbsp;I am only able to work on the game on the side. My dream is to be able to work fulltime on my solo-projects, but regardless of if I am able to achieve that goal or not I will keep making games.</p>\r\n<h3><a href=\"https://patreon.com/Markusaw?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=join_link&utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&utm_content=copyLink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">GET ACCESS TO DEV BUILD WITH PATREON</a></h3><p>Patreon members can also vote for the theme of the next major update&nbsp;in a poll.</p>\r\n<p><iframe height=\"167\" width=\"552\" src=\"https://itch.io/embed/3332044?bg_color=a99c78&fg_color=ffffff&link_color=ed9a11&border_color=4b5770\" frameborder=\"0\"><a href=\"https://markusaw.itch.io/epoch\">Epoch: Alternate History by Markusaw</a></iframe><br></p>\r\n<h2>DISCLAIMER: THIS GAME IS IN DEVELOPMENT SO THERE MAY BE BUGS, PERFORMANCE ISSUES AND&nbsp;A LACK OF FEATURES</h2>\r\n<h2>Features:</h2>\r\n<ul><li><strong>136 playable countries -</strong> In a present day scenario starting in 2019</li><li><strong>100 000 BCE scenario</strong> - Featuring completely different gameplay</li><li><strong>War -</strong> Ability to wage war with armies and fleets moving on the map</li><li><strong>Construction -</strong> Build bases and other structures within your borders</li><li><strong>AI Leaders -</strong> The AI takes into account lots of factors in their decision making. Each time you start the game their traits get randomized across the world.</li><li><strong>Rebellions -</strong> Instability can lead to rebel uprisings</li><li><strong>Federations/Unions -</strong>&nbsp;AI countries can join together to create a larger, stronger nation</li><li><strong>Every Citizen&nbsp;Simulated -&nbsp;</strong>Simulates political opinions of every single person in the world</li></ul>\r\n<h3><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://discord.com/invite/HeUUyM9Pjy\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Join the Discord!</a></h3>\r\n<h2>F.A.Q</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Q: When is the Steam release?</strong></p>\r\n<p>A: Probably in a while. The quality of my game needs to be up to a certain standard for me to want to do a Steam release. I have a list of things that the game needs for the release, like music and connecting the earliest start to the latest so you can play through all of human history among others.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Q: Why do some countries on the map not have their actual flags in the 2019 scenario?</strong></p>\r\n<p>A: As a solo developer I have to split my attention between many different areas of development. Because of this I have decided to give lower priority to scenario editing while keeping my focus on adding new game mechanics. So the 2019 scenario is very unfinished and getting slowly improved. 0.17 is receiving a flag rework, so I am starting flags from scratch, but it will be a way better system.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Q: When is the next update?</strong></p>\r\n<p>A: Itch.io only receives the major updates (like 0.14 - 0.15 - 0.16) while&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/Markusaw?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=join_link&utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&utm_content=copyLink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Patreon</a>&nbsp;members get all the dev builds in between. (like 0.15.3. - 0.15.4 - 0.15.5). The dev builds get released around once a month but there may be different wait times between updates. While major updates get released when they are done.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>In addition to gaining access to dev builds, patreon membership also allows you to take part in polls regarding the future of Epoch&#x27;s development.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Q: Do you use generative AI?</strong></p>\r\n<p>A: No AI is used. I take pride&nbsp;in the fact that this game is 100% human made. And I intend to keep it that way.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h5>Socials:</h5>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@epoch_alternate_history\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Tiktok</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://youtube.com/@800markus?si=uQ-qVpoqUPz395Yb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Youtube</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/epoch_alternate_history/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Instagram</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=channel_description&redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUlBidHRZaVdzWUtjQmZE